    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100331" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεπι-τίθημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>help in putting on, put on still more</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.728c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>join in attacking</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ Μήδῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.54
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				6.17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ τῆς τύχης πταίσματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Vit.</u>
					p.21J.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.23
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				6.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				16a
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				4.2.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				6.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1311b17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>De.</u>
				32.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				24.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τῷ ἔργῳ</span>
			<i>fall to</i> the work <i>together</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.56
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>set upon and use to one's own advantage</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τῇ ἀγνοίᾳ, τῷ μίσει τινός</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.43.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς καιροῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.15.10
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				5.87.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τισὶ ἁμαρτίαν</span>
			<i>lay</i> a sin <i>to their charge</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Nu.</u>
				12.11
			</span></i>.</div>
